cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "lstid-vespagram: LSTID catalogue from GNSS TEC keograms"
abstract: >-
  lstid-vespagram detects equatorward large-scale travelling ionospheric
  disturbances (LSTIDs) in daily GNSS TEC keograms over Europe (37.5–57.5°N,
  2015–2025) with a vespagram (slant-stack) method from array seismology,
  groups them into wave trains with a confidence score, and produces every
  number and figure of the accompanying data descriptor.
authors:
  - family-names: Guerra
    given-names: Marco
    affiliation: "Istituto Nazionale di Geofisica e Vulcanologia (INGV)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9993-2366"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mguerra96/lstid-vespagram"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-20"
keywords:
  - LSTID
  - travelling ionospheric disturbances
  - GNSS
  - total electron content
  - keogram
  - vespagram
  - ionosphere
